    narr:narration """The current infrastructure trajectory is defined by a [decisive migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785148094404_4) from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, slated for [Q3 2026](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785148094404_6). This shift is framed as a [settled operational imperative](narr:Narrative_InfrastructureMigrationAsserted) rather than a tentative proposal, anchored in [quantified performance and cost metrics](narr:Narrative_QuantifiedCostBenefitJustification). The core argument rests on a projected [10x improvement in analytical query speed](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785148094404_5) alongside reduced licensing overhead. While the technical justification is presented with high conviction, the discourse remains focused on the immediate, concrete benefits of the transition, prioritizing efficiency gains and market-based rationales for the change.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1785148094404_1> ;
